err_jsx_live.vuka:49:3: <NoRender> embeds vuka.Live but has no Render() vuka.Node method
err_jsx_live.vuka:50:3: <BadRender>'s Render is func(ctx context.Context) Node; a stateful component's is func() vuka.Node
err_jsx_live.vuka:51:3: <Ptr> embeds *vuka.Live; embed vuka.Live by value
err_jsx_live.vuka:52:3: <Named> is a type, not a component: a component is a function returning a vuka.Node, or a struct embedding vuka.Live with a Render() vuka.Node method
err_jsx_live.vuka:53:12: <Counter> has no attribute n: unexported fields are its state; its props are its exported fields
err_jsx_live.vuka:54:12: <Counter> has no attribute Stat; did you mean Start?
err_jsx_live.vuka:55:3: <Counter> takes no children: add a Children vuka.Node field to Counter
err_jsx_live.vuka:56:3: <BadMount>'s Mount is func(n int); it takes nothing or a context.Context, and returns nothing or an error
err_jsx_live.vuka:57:3: <Box> is generic: write its type arguments, <Box[…]>
err_jsx_live.vuka:58:9: <Both>'s field Title is ambiguous: it is in A and B
err_jsx_live.vuka:59:11: onClick on <button> takes a func(), a func taking the event's value (a string, number or bool), a form (a struct, or url.Values) or a vuka.Event, optionally after a context.Context, returning nothing or an error; this is int
